  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_agency": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Details of the ground floor/ podium level cladding hereby approved shall be submitted in writing to the local planning authority and approved prior to the commencement of those works at ground floor/ podium level.\n\nREASON: To ensure that the proposed replacement cladding is of high quality and is applied in a way that works well with the existing elevations in accordance with policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan (2020).\n",
    "All new external finishes in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in connection) shall be as indicated on the approved plan Dwg.no. PL-010 - Location Plan; Dwg.no. PL-1010 - Site Plan; Dwg.no. PL-1031E - Existing North and South Elevations; Dwg. no. PL-1030E - Existing East and West Elevations; Dwg.no. PL-1030 Rev B - Proposed East and West Elevations; Dwg.no. PL-1031 Rev B - Proposed North and South Elevations; and Design & Access Statement - rev C - October 2020.\n\nREASON: To ensure that the external appearance of the building is satisfactory and does not detract from the character and visual amenity of the area in accordance with policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan (2020).\n",
    "The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\n\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.",
    "The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.\n\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 as amended."
  ],
